sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant B as Browser (React)
  participant A as FastAPI /messages
  participant G as Agent orchestrator
  participant K as Knowledge base (RAG)
  participant D as SQLite
  participant L as LLM (optional)
  C->>B: speaks "Tell me about your AI course"
  B->>B: SpeechRecognition -> text
  B->>A: POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages
  A->>G: handle(text)
  G->>D: save message, update_customer_profile
  G->>D: analyze_sentiment -> sentiment_records
  G->>K: search_knowledge_base(query + remembered interest)
  K-->>G: top chunks + scores (found / not found)
  G->>D: update_crm_record, qualify_lead (score + reasons)
  alt LLM configured and KB found
    G->>L: system prompt + retrieved chunks + recent turns
    L-->>G: grounded answer
  else demo mode or LLM error
    G->>G: template answer quoting the chunks (labelled)
  end
  G->>D: save assistant message (+ sources, generated_by)
  A-->>B: reply, sources, lead, sentiment, tool trace
  B->>C: speechSynthesis reads the reply
